LSP 3.17 lifecycle (IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN §8.4 Transport): a request before initialize is refused,
initialize offers UTF-16 positions and full sync only (DECISIONS 274), an unknown method and a
body that is not JSON are errors, a client response (an id, no method) is ignored, shutdown then exit ends the session cleanly.
-- script --
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"textDocument/hover","params":{}}
initialize
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"initialized","params":{}}
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"textDocument/completion","params":{}}
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"initialize","params":{}}
raw {not json
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"$/cancelRequest","params":{"id":2}}
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":7,"result":null}
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":"s","method":"shutdown"}
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"shutdown"}
send {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"exit"}
